sequenceDiagram
  participant P0 as Sender
  participant P1 as Chat service
  participant P2 as History
  participant P3 as Recipient
  P0->>P1: Message with client ID
  P1->>P2: Persist with conversation sequence
  P2->>P1: Durable acknowledgment
  P1->>P0: Accepted message ID
  P1->>P3: Live delivery
  P3-->>P1: Connection lost
  P3->>P1: Reconnect after cursor
  P1->>P2: Read missing history
  P1->>P3: Replay newer messages
